# A small transport thesaurus connects concepts, labels and an ordered group.
# With --skos, cycling is transitively narrower than travel and aligned with biking.
# This shows SKOS Core entailment without making broader or closeMatch transitive.
# Vocabulary and semantics: W3C SKOS Reference, https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/ .

@prefix : <https://example.org/transport#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

# Top concepts imply scheme membership and Concept typing.
:scheme skos:hasTopConcept :travel .
:cycling skos:prefLabel "Cycling"@en ;
    skos:broader :activeTravel ;
    skos:exactMatch :biking .
:activeTravel skos:broader :travel .
:biking skos:exactMatch :bikeTravel .

# Ordered membership entails ordinary collection membership.
:activeModes skos:memberList (:cycling :walking) .
:walking skos:definition "Travel on foot"@en ; skos:related :cycling .
